 the /etc/qemu-web-desktop/machines.conf file (use: qwdctl edit machines),
 and run: qwdctl refresh.
 You can tune the service settings in the
 /etc/qemu-web-desktop/config.pl (use: qwdctl edit config).
 This project is also named Data Analysis Remote Treatment Service (DARTS).
 .
 Once installed, connect to http://server/qemu-web-desktop

